{"seq":3,"slug":"tool-orchestration","title":"工具编排与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/tool-integration/tool-orchestration","wordCount":1070,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"工具编排与调度\">工具编排与调度</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>工具编排是 Agent 系统中连接 LLM 推理能力与外部工具执行的中间层。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么需要编排器\">为什么需要编排器</h3><ul>\n<li>当 Agent 需要调用多个工具、处理工具间依赖关系、管理并发执行和故障恢复时，简单的工具调用已不能满足需求</li>\n<li>工具编排器负责将 LLM 的工具调用意图转化为高效、可靠的执行计划</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[LLM 调用意图]--&gt;B[编排器]&#10;    B--&gt;C{依赖分析}&#10;    C--&gt;|无依赖|D[并行执行池]&#10;    C--&gt;|有依赖|E[拓扑排序]&#10;    E--&gt;D&#10;    D--&gt;F[工具 A]&#10;    D--&gt;G[工具 B]&#10;    F--&gt;I[结果聚合]&#10;    G--&gt;I&#10;    I--&gt;J[返回 LLM]\">flowchart TD\n    A[LLM 调用意图]--&gt;B[编排器]\n    B--&gt;C{依赖分析}\n    C--&gt;|无依赖|D[并行执行池]\n    C--&gt;|有依赖|E[拓扑排序]\n    E--&gt;D\n    D--&gt;F[工具 A]\n    D--&gt;G[工具 B]\n    F--&gt;I[结果聚合]\n    G--&gt;I\n    I--&gt;J[返回 LLM]</pre><h3 id=\"五种编排策略\">五种编排策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编排策略</th>\n<th>执行方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>顺序执行</td>\n<td>逐个调用</td>\n<td>简单依赖链</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行执行</td>\n<td>同时调用</td>\n<td>独立工具集</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DAG 调度</td>\n<td>拓扑排序</td>\n<td>复杂依赖图</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>最优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>管道模式</td>\n<td>流式传递</td>\n<td>数据处理链</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回退策略</td>\n<td>备选工具</td>\n<td>高可用场景</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"并行执行引擎\">并行执行引擎</h2><ul>\n<li>当多个工具调用之间没有数据依赖时，并行执行可以大幅减少总延迟</li>\n<li>编排器需要识别独立的工具调用并管理并发</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"单个调用的执行单元\">单个调用的执行单元</h3><p>每次执行带超时竞争与错误捕获，输出统一的结果结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const executeOne = async (call: ToolCall) =&gt; {&#10;  const handler = registry.get(call.name);&#10;  try {&#10;    const data = await Promise.race([handler(call.args), timeoutAfter(config.timeout)]);&#10;    return { id: call.id, success: true, data };&#10;  } catch (error) {&#10;    return { id: call.id, success: false, data: error.message };&#10;  }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> executeOne</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">call</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ToolCall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> handler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> registry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(call.name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">race</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(call.args), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">timeoutAfter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(config.timeout)]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { id: call.id, success: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, data };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { id: call.id, success: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, data: error.message };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"分批并发\">分批并发</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const batchExecute = async (batch: ToolCall[]) =&gt; {&#10;  for (const chunk of chunksOf(batch, config.maxConcurrency)) {&#10;    const chunkResults = await Promise.all(chunk.map(executeOne));&#10;    chunkResults.forEach((r) =&gt; results.set(r.id, r));&#10;  }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> batchExecute</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ToolCall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> chunk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> chunksOf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(batch, config.maxConcurrency)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> chunkResults</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(chunk.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(executeOne));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    chunkResults.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r.id, r));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>先执行无依赖的调用</li>\n<li>再循环挑出「依赖已全部完成」的调用继续批量执行</li>\n<li>直到没有可推进的任务</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"并发上限\">并发上限</h3><p>并行执行的关键约束是<strong>最大并发数</strong>控制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>并发设置</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过高</td>\n<td>触发外部 API 速率限制或资源争用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5-10</td>\n<td>推荐的并行任务数区间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"依赖图与-dag-调度\">依赖图与 DAG 调度</h2><ul>\n<li>当工具调用之间存在数据依赖时，需要构建有向无环图（DAG）并按拓扑顺序执行</li>\n<li>确保每个工具在其依赖完成后才执行</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"分层拓扑排序\">分层拓扑排序</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>统计每个调用的入度（依赖数）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>入度为 0 的调用进入第 0 层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>每完成一层，给下游调用的入度减 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>新的入度 0 调用进入下一层，直到队列耗尽</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"while (queue.length &gt; 0) {&#10;  levels.set(level, [...queue]);&#10;  const nextQueue: ToolCall[] = [];&#10;  for (const call of queue) {&#10;    for (const depId of adjList.get(call.id) ?? []) {&#10;      if (decrementInDegree(depId) === 0) {&#10;        nextQueue.push(byId(depId));&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  queue = nextQueue;&#10;  level++;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (queue.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  levels.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(level, [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">queue]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nextQueue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ToolCall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> call</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queue) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> depId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adjList.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(call.id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">decrementInDegree</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(depId) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        nextQueue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">byId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(depId));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  queue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nextQueue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"dag-调度的优势\">DAG 调度的优势</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最大化并行度</td>\n<td>同一层级的工具可以并行执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最少等待</td>\n<td>只有跨层级的依赖才需要等待</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"重试与降级策略\">重试与降级策略</h2><ul>\n<li>生产环境中工具调用可能因网络、超时或服务端错误而失败</li>\n<li>编排器需要实现智能的重试和降级策略</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"指数退避-抖动\">指数退避 + 抖动</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const getDelay = (attempt: number) =&gt; {&#10;  const delay = base * Math.pow(multiplier, attempt);&#10;  const jitter = Math.random() * delay * 0.1;&#10;  return Math.min(delay + jitter, maxDelay);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getDelay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">attempt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> delay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(multiplier, attempt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> jitter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delay </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(delay </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jitter, maxDelay);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"可重试判定与降级\">可重试判定与降级</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const retryExecutor = createRetryableExecutor({&#10;  maxAttempts: 3,&#10;  baseDelay: 1000,&#10;  maxDelay: 10000,&#10;  backoffMultiplier: 2,&#10;  retryableErrors: [&#39;TIMEOUT&#39;, &#39;RATE_LIMIT&#39;, &#39;SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE&#39;],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> retryExecutor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createRetryableExecutor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  maxAttempts: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  baseDelay: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  maxDelay: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  backoffMultiplier: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  retryableErrors: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TIMEOUT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RATE_LIMIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>只有错误信息命中 <code>retryableErrors</code> 模式才重试</li>\n<li>重试耗尽后若配置了 <code>fallback</code> 则降级执行，否则抛出最后一次错误</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"策略对比\">策略对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用错误类型</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定间隔重试</td>\n<td>临时网络错误</td>\n<td>等待固定时间后重试</td>\n<td>可能加剧负载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数退避</td>\n<td>速率限制</td>\n<td>每次等待时间翻倍</td>\n<td>延迟较高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>断路器</td>\n<td>持续性故障</td>\n<td>连续失败后停止重试</td>\n<td>需要恢复机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降级执行</td>\n<td>工具不可用</td>\n<td>使用替代工具</td>\n<td>结果可能有差异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"结果聚合与缓存\">结果聚合与缓存</h2><ul>\n<li>多工具执行的结果需要聚合为 LLM 可消费的格式</li>\n<li>同时通过缓存避免重复执行</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"缓存键与-ttl\">缓存键与 TTL</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const getCacheKey = (name: string, args: object) =&gt; `${name}:${stableStringify(args)}`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getCacheKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:${</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stableStringify</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缓存键</td>\n<td>工具名 + 参数的稳定序列化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过期处理</td>\n<td>命中过期条目时删除并返回未命中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容量淘汰</td>\n<td>超过 <code>maxSize</code> 时按插入顺序淘汰最早项</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"按工具特性定缓存策略\">按工具特性定缓存策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具类型</th>\n<th>缓存建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实时数据查询（如股价）</td>\n<td>不应缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态信息查询（如文档搜索）</td>\n<td>可设较长 TTL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>工具编排器是 LLM 意图与工具执行之间的中间层，负责依赖分析、并发控制和故障恢复</li>\n<li>无依赖的工具调用应并行执行，并发数控制在 5-10 以避免触发速率限制</li>\n<li>DAG 调度通过拓扑排序最大化并行度，确保依赖顺序正确</li>\n<li>重试策略应使用指数退避加抖动，结合断路器模式防止雪崩</li>\n<li>工具结果缓存可避免重复执行，但需根据数据时效性设置合理的 TTL</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"工具编排与调度","id":"工具编排与调度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么需要编排器","id":"为什么需要编排器"},{"level":3,"text":"五种编排策略","id":"五种编排策略"},{"level":2,"text":"并行执行引擎","id":"并行执行引擎"},{"level":3,"text":"单个调用的执行单元","id":"单个调用的执行单元"},{"level":3,"text":"分批并发","id":"分批并发"},{"level":3,"text":"并发上限","id":"并发上限"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖图与 DAG 调度","id":"依赖图与-dag-调度"},{"level":3,"text":"分层拓扑排序","id":"分层拓扑排序"},{"level":3,"text":"DAG 调度的优势","id":"dag-调度的优势"},{"level":2,"text":"重试与降级策略","id":"重试与降级策略"},{"level":3,"text":"指数退避 + 抖动","id":"指数退避-抖动"},{"level":3,"text":"可重试判定与降级","id":"可重试判定与降级"},{"level":3,"text":"策略对比","id":"策略对比"},{"level":2,"text":"结果聚合与缓存","id":"结果聚合与缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"缓存键与 TTL","id":"缓存键与-ttl"},{"level":3,"text":"按工具特性定缓存策略","id":"按工具特性定缓存策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MCP 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/tool-integration/mcp-protocol"},"next":{"title":